# Contract v1.3: the composition shows only in the panel's input line (pinyin with syllable spaces, a draft as
# "improve › ok"), never as marked text in the field; the field gets text only on commit.
NAME Backspace removes the only letter typed
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE n
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit "n"
KEY backspace
EXPECT doc "Hi "
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit none
EXPECT panel hidden
